WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.850
- You want to sleep on our turf,

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.690
you've got to pay the rent old man.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.427
- Hey. Leave him alone.

00:00:07.427 --> 00:00:09.760
(screaming)

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.320
- You don't know how you did that, do you?

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.963
Allow me to explain.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:22.590
Throughout history, there have
been warriors called Knights.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.903
I believe Athena will save the world.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.940
Whenever Athena is in danger,

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.953
the Knights come into existence.

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:39.469
This is your destiny.

00:00:45.273 --> 00:00:47.690
(rock music)

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.503
- We have to attack together!

00:00:58.503 --> 00:01:00.920
(gun firing)

00:01:01.799 --> 00:01:04.010
(screaming)

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.427
(rock music)

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:11.060
- I should have killed you early.

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:17.163
- If we die, we die together.

00:01:20.103 --> 00:01:23.234
(screaming)

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:25.651
(rock music)

